<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 522.5 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 522.5 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 522.5 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    One year	 42	     42		  8.50 pct</p>
<p>    Two years	30	     Nil</p>
<p>    Five years    385	     385		10.00 pct</p>
<p>    15 years	 95		95		10.50 pct</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	   552.5	   522.5</p>
<p>Maturity (jouissance) was set for February 24, 1997.</p>
<p>($1= 9.2 dirhams)</p>
<p>((- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518)</p>
